WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:06,680
Hey, hey, why does my dad talk so much nonsense?

2
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,800
How could a person like me not know how to eat?

3
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,280
I'm still worried that the girl from the Song family will lie to me

4
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:11,600
Do you think I am stupid?

5
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:16,430
I'm relieved

6
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:20,720
Our Duke's Mansion doesn't have so many rules. I like it.

7
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:33,150
If you put poop in the room, you become a friend.

8
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:37,020
It's rare to meet a big brother when the young master is not good

9
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:39,180
Didn't you come here specifically to pick me up?

10
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:45,760
What will I do if I pick you up? Okay?

11
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:46,760
Stop pretending to be pitiful

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,850
Why did you want to get up and run to me? Hey, brother

13
00:00:51,850 --> 00:00:54,290
My father asked me to take you to Wucheng Binggas
